+Read residual or report-monitor history
+---------------------------------------
+
+**User prompt:**
+
+*"Show the last 50 residual samples from the current Fluent session."*
+
+**Expected tool sequence:**
+
+#. Call ``read_monitor_history()`` to list monitor sets known to the session.
+#. If the list includes ``residual``, call
+   ``read_monitor_history(monitor_set="residual", max_points=50)``.
+#. Plot each monitor series against the sample indices in ``x_values``.
+   If the result is empty, report that the session has no captured samples.
+   Retry the read if the tool returns ``monitor_set_refreshed``.
+
+An attached session can have partial or empty history. To capture residuals
+for a new solve, enable the residual plot before initialization.
+
 Next steps
 ----------
 
